  "term": "computer programming",
  "definition": "Computer programming is the activity of learning and using coding skills in computer science education. In this learning context, it is studied as being related to computational thinking, including skills such as breaking problems into parts, putting steps in order, and forming abstractions that can be used beyond computer science.",
